        "created_at": "2025-07-27T14:20:21.185159+00:00",
        "notes": "# POWERS\n[Inner Peace](item_3cb26943-7c02-4aa2-97d0-7411dac1073c) is the best pick here. From my mediocre testing, it does just as much, if not better, healing than the nerfed [Dual Harmony](item_6484b4c4-294c-410d-ae1d-8049f161df31) Orbs and makes you less vulnerable overall.\n\nNotice that we aren't selecting [Discord Inferno](item_cf48f92d-a1d1-420a-b0e3-01ed290faa62) yet, despite it unlocking us some great damage potentional. Most other Zenyatta builds begin with selecting [Inner Peace](item_3cb26943-7c02-4aa2-97d0-7411dac1073c) and then [Enlightenment](item_8392e752-ca6b-487d-9580-11eab6075c3c), so by us selecting [Inner Peace](item_3cb26943-7c02-4aa2-97d0-7411dac1073c) first, we give ourselves two rounds to see if this is a build we want to commit to or not. If by the very start of the round you want to commit to this build, [Discord Inferno](item_cf48f92d-a1d1-420a-b0e3-01ed290faa62) alongside the optional powers below are viable but not as recommended.\n\n# OPTIONAL POWERS\nUse [Dual Harmony](item_6484b4c4-294c-410d-ae1d-8049f161df31) if you somehow aren't taking any damage. I include [Gotta Have Faith](item_b1c30cfc-b920-4d1e-91f3-98c16ca0c3d7) only because it *is* an option, but don't get it. As stated before, [Discord Inferno](item_cf48f92d-a1d1-420a-b0e3-01ed290faa62) is a viable option.\n\n# ITEMS\n[Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418) for extra healing, [Charged Plating](item_b8ca58e7-6ae2-40ee-8618-fe2f32315295) for even more healing and armor after your ult, and [Winning Attitude](item_8714087c-c078-4619-a2ef-327bc6edaa69) to help you get your ult if you're off to a rough start.\n\n# OPTIONAL ITEMS\nIf you're really good at not dying, get [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) to help you take less damage.",
