        "notes": "# ITEMS\nWe're keeping the same green items as before and simply adding [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) and, importantly, [Satya's Solution](item_1710519d-210a-4b92-b9ed-234abf6ade2c), which is an item we'll want to keep heading forward.\n\n# OPTIONAL ITEMS\nIf you end up just shy of $13.5K, [Custom Stock](item_17d633af-8bcc-4893-b865-be0a7bc66fe2) is slightly cheaper and even gives some extra [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power).",
