        "notes": "# POWERS\n[Soul Control](item_051aca60-1044-4184-bbbf-5aad8b12592a) is where this build will shine the most, allowing you to use your ultimate so much more freely and win many more team fights. Without [Mondatta's Mantra](item_96d3b160-3c50-4768-90e4-c7005c98ce43), you have 1.5 seconds of Transcendence uptime before the ult charge begins ticking down, so if you're in a tricky spot and see that you're gonna die, pop that ult and get out knowing that you'll almost have your ultimate again. Just make sure to track the enemy's ultimates.\n\n*Note: This round is your last* **best** *chance to diverge into a more traditional Zenyatta build focusing more on [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power) with [Enlightenment](item_8392e752-ca6b-487d-9580-11eab6075c3c) if within the first two rounds you feel that your ultimate usage won't create enough value (or that you are getting swept too hard to get your ultimate in time.)*\n\n# ITEMS\nWe add [Catalytic Crystal](item_3e3f4f77-cdf8-4dda-a5b0-2fb9390aefc4) to give us more [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) and to help us get our ultimate faster.",
