        "notes": "# ITEMS\n[Friendship Bracelet](item_abc52eaf-cb2e-4e0b-8b5d-15e9f7bae003) boosts the healing of both your ally's Harmony Orb and your Transcendence by up to 20% based off distance, granting healing up to 98% [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) equivalent. Note that the 20% healing boost does NOT apply to the [Inner Peace](item_3cb26943-7c02-4aa2-97d0-7411dac1073c) Orb, so if you chose [Dual Harmony](item_6484b4c4-294c-410d-ae1d-8049f161df31) instead, this item will do you even better.\n\n# OPTIONAL ITEMS\n[Mondatta's Mantra](item_96d3b160-3c50-4768-90e4-c7005c98ce43) is a wonderful item we'll introduce soon, but at this point in the game I don't believe it's worth the lack of [Ability Power](stat_ability_power). If you want to reward yourself more for your damage output as well as boosting your [Ability Power](stat_ability_power), [Orb of Perception](item_762bf2a4-c062-4dfd-b8e0-47e37ba1cadf) can do just that. If you're struggling to get ult charge in the early fights of a match, [Mind Shaper](item_c902b4f2-1151-4ec8-8dcd-f55144a45eb7) gives you 15% Starting Ultimate Charge and Ability Power along with ally cooldown reduction to help make more value out of those longer Transcendences.",
