        "notes": "# POWERS\nAnd finally, we get [Discord Inferno](item_cf48f92d-a1d1-420a-b0e3-01ed290faa62). With our [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) at 80%, you'll be doing 237.5 damage on a discorded headshot.\n\n# ITEMS\n[Mondatta's Mantra](item_96d3b160-3c50-4768-90e4-c7005c98ce43) increases our window of 75% ult charge during Transcendence from 1.5 seconds to 1.95 seconds. This gives us extra leeway if use an ult to escape danger, as well as an opportunity for us to turn the fight around after a quick healing burst with insane amounts of overhealth.\n\n# OPTIONAL ITEMS\nAlthough we sold [Friendship Bracelet](item_abc52eaf-cb2e-4e0b-8b5d-15e9f7bae003), it is still perfectly fine here if you want to focus on healing more than having a longer Transcendence. [Haste Subroutine](item_be06e8c1-baa4-4c24-ae40-c103c45ea0c3) grants no [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) but can help you land those tricky headshots. [Orb of Perception](item_762bf2a4-c062-4dfd-b8e0-47e37ba1cadf) and [Mind Shaper](item_c902b4f2-1151-4ec8-8dcd-f55144a45eb7) are still helpful just as helpful here as before.",
