        "created_at": "2025-07-27T14:20:21.185159+00:00",
        "notes": "# POWERS\nIn this final round you have three main options:\n- [Circle of Strife](item_f004a339-4ad2-41c6-bda2-addf1222f151) to make prolonged teamfights more devastating for the enemy\n- [Discord Fever](item_f6bede6a-a54c-4133-b171-78b5a282681f) to pair with [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) and/or [Liquid Nitrogen](item_a8d99526-05a3-4405-babb-b025479b1b98) \n- [Instant Karma](item_7a1cb409-3f6d-424f-882f-729c59476130) to help defend against dives\n\nAll options work well here depending on your specific circumstance. Before going the [Discord Fever](item_f6bede6a-a54c-4133-b171-78b5a282681f) route, make sure your teammates do not already have these items used, especially if you are playing with a [Moira](hero_7fb6ff1e-a193-40c0-bd0a-25c1928fbaed).\n\nA synergy that is not possible by this point is that of [Circle of Strife](item_f004a339-4ad2-41c6-bda2-addf1222f151) and [Discord Fever](item_f6bede6a-a54c-4133-b171-78b5a282681f). Although a potent combo, especially with the aforementioned items, you must sacrifice either your personal Harmony Orb or the extra [Discord Inferno](item_cf48f92d-a1d1-420a-b0e3-01ed290faa62) damage, which I do not find to be worth it unless I am going against difficult-to-hit targets such as [Freja](hero_e80840a1-845d-4008-966c-585b7cb4a424), [Juno](hero_035c63b7-084c-4abd-9de5-c9a00e9b6a18) and [Mercy](hero_0e213bfc-3ca9-49c6-9036-e7f344b752da).\n\n# OPTIONAL ITEMS\n[Meditation Mat](item_ce90ebff-042d-423c-a2f6-d38778629bba) gives extra armor as well as Area of Effect damage to anyone within about 5m of you when your shields are depleted.",
